GitHub OAuth2 authentication has been successfully integrated into the Crypto Price Aggregator application. The implementation provides:

✅ Secure authentication via GitHub
✅ User profile persistence in PostgreSQL  
✅ Session-based API access
✅ Modern, premium UI for login/logout
✅ Backward compatibility with Basic Auth
✅ Full Docker integration

The application is now ready for testing. Once verified, update the documentation and proceed with creating comprehensive tests.
